{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id103056722?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"HalloHanno"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-22T18:51:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.6.11"}, "id":{"label":"12924829233"}, "title":{"label":"Competition does a better job"}, "content":{"label":"I chose this bank because they offered some banking perks which suit me. If I had chosen bank in Hong Kong by banking app I would have gone to the competition. For me this is the worst banking app. A few examples:\n- after every - yes, every - single logout the app will ask you to rate. You rate and guess what happens next time you log out: rate again! So it’s faster to just close the app before logging in again\n- app update: you realise an app update is available when you cannot log into your banking app. Is it too expensive to do like other banks and have a little pop up window saying that your app requires updating?\n- transfers and payments to your credit card don’t show up immediately despite being banking hours. Competition does a better job and shows actual balances immediately", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
